":708313,"title":"","content":"Finally. I've been looking forward to this project for a while now. With any luck my overtime will pick back up so I can invest a bit more than I have in the past.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-19T00:46:06-07:00","id":708327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/708273-shattered-dreams-2-days-to-go?p=708292#post708292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Woo! I am really looking forward to this. I am practically drooling over here. <br /> <br /> You have fun writing it, Bunyip?</div> </div> </div> </div>Way too much fun! (That's a bit too straightforward an answer. How can I make it more cryptic?)<br /> <br /> I've been allowed to run with something that was sitting in the back of my mind since Umbra. I teased out more detail from stuff included in Changing Breeds. And I drew on a lot of things from BotW. <br /> <br /> Way too much fun <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkn